   535→// checkDisabledGuard checks if Entire is disabled and prints a message if so.
   536→// Returns true if the caller should exit (i.e., Entire is disabled).
   537→// On error reading settings, defaults to enabled (returns false).
   538→func checkDisabledGuard(w io.Writer) bool {
